   "t": "Мы такой же нож купим.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "А ты знаешь, что это за нож?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "A missing knife, and no one is allowed home. In the next episode, you might hear some of these useful phrases again.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "Счастливо!",
   "gap": 0.3
